{"3778400": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Master of the Mow", "steam_appid": 3778400, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You find a job flyer promising quick cash for grounds-keeping at a neglected manor on the edge of town. You start making progress on your first day, but when you wake up the next morning, the entire estate has reset back to its original overgrown state.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778400/extras/d647cf6196735cfec97596744cb546eb.avif?t=1785865324\" width=1080 height=106 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778400/extras/cc66bee01b6a84295a4ea96eda175dbe.poster.avif?t=1785865324\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778400/extras/cc66bee01b6a84295a4ea96eda175dbe.webm?t=1785865324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778400/extras/cc66bee01b6a84295a4ea96eda175dbe.mp4?t=1785865324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncut lawns, new trash and wild weeds return. Mow, restore, unearth, and push deeper into the property. Each day you get stronger and reach places you could not before. But one question remains. Why won’t the grass stay cut?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778400/extras/a468a5d7ee1b618e92055a1fa574d28f.avif?t=1785865324\" width=1200 height=106 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778400/extras/92db48474d9bd2c65f7f374e8aea3aa8.poster.avif?t=1785865324\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778400/extras/92db48474d9bd2c65f7f374e8aea3aa8.webm?t=1785865324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778400/extras/92db48474d9bd2c65f7f374e8aea3aa8.mp4?t=1785865324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While the mysterious grounds continue to reset, there are no time limits.  Take your time and enjoy the satisfying rhythm of transforming the overgrown into serene scenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778400/extras/3cc04482db2038241652b68a0d37e410.avif?t=1785865324\" width=1200 height=106 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778400/extras/e3bf8310521a4ceff9ccf07da0d8dc17.poster.avif?t=1785865324\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778400/extras/e3bf8310521a4ceff9ccf07da0d8dc17.webm?t=1785865324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778400/extras/e3bf8310521a4ceff9ccf07da0d8dc17.mp4?t=1785865324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell the trinkets you uncover to purchase better gear, abilities, and upgrades. Everything has value!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778400/extras/23cc3f9cd366765768474758fd9d292e.avif?t=1785865324\" width=1080 height=106 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778400/extras/3af5f9a8c495e970145e5d40fb6920c8.poster.avif?t=1785865324\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778400/extras/3af5f9a8c495e970145e5d40fb6920c8.webm?t=1785865324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778400/extras/3af5f9a8c495e970145e5d40fb6920c8.mp4?t=1785865324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade everything. Prove you’re the Master of the Mow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You find a job flyer promising quick cash for grounds-keeping at a neglected manor on the edge of town. You start making progress on your first day, but when you wake up the next morning, the entire estate has reset back to its original overgrown state.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778400/extras/d647cf6196735cfec97596744cb546eb.avif?t=1785865324\" width=1080 height=106 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778400/extras/cc66bee01b6a84295a4ea96eda175dbe.poster.avif?t=1785865324\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778400/extras/cc66bee01b6a84295a4ea96eda175dbe.webm?t=1785865324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778400/extras/cc66bee01b6a84295a4ea96eda175dbe.mp4?t=1785865324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncut lawns, new trash and wild weeds return. Mow, restore, unearth, and push deeper into the property. Each day you get stronger and reach places you could not before. But one question remains. Why won’t the grass stay cut?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778400/extras/a468a5d7ee1b618e92055a1fa574d28f.avif?t=1785865324\" width=1200 height=106 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778400/extras/92db48474d9bd2c65f7f374e8aea3aa8.poster.avif?t=1785865324\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778400/extras/92db48474d9bd2c65f7f374e8aea3aa8.webm?t=1785865324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778400/extras/92db48474d9bd2c65f7f374e8aea3aa8.mp4?t=1785865324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While the mysterious grounds continue to reset, there are no time limits.  Take your time and enjoy the satisfying rhythm of transforming the overgrown into serene scenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778400/extras/3cc04482db2038241652b68a0d37e410.avif?t=1785865324\" width=1200 height=106 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778400/extras/e3bf8310521a4ceff9ccf07da0d8dc17.poster.avif?t=1785865324\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778400/extras/e3bf8310521a4ceff9ccf07da0d8dc17.webm?t=1785865324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778400/extras/e3bf8310521a4ceff9ccf07da0d8dc17.mp4?t=1785865324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell the trinkets you uncover to purchase better gear, abilities, and upgrades. Everything has value!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778400/extras/23cc3f9cd366765768474758fd9d292e.avif?t=1785865324\" width=1080 height=106 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778400/extras/3af5f9a8c495e970145e5d40fb6920c8.poster.avif?t=1785865324\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778400/extras/3af5f9a8c495e970145e5d40fb6920c8.webm?t=1785865324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778400/extras/3af5f9a8c495e970145e5d40fb6920c8.mp4?t=1785865324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade everything. Prove you’re the Master of the Mow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Become the Master of the Mow. Cut grass, clear trash, and uncover buried treasures across the overgrown grounds of an old manor estate. Upgrade your tools and grow stronger with each trinket you sell and solve the mystery of why the grass grows back every morning. Can you finish it 